# An allowlist: `data/` is the owner's real database and their whole game archive, and
# nothing outside these paths is needed to build the image.
*
!backend/
!web/
!docker/
!alembic.ini
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md

# `web/dist` is produced by the node stage inside the build. A host build copied in would
# be whatever was last run locally — possibly stale, possibly pointed at a dev backend.
web/dist/
web/node_modules/
web/.vite/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
